<title>CHILE: Hoyts to invest A$50 million in Chile.</title>
<headline>Hoyts to invest A$50 million in Chile.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Hoyts Cinemas Group said it will invest $50 million in Chile, including $20 million on building five cinema complexes in Santiago with 49 screens.</p>
<p>&quot;The project will also involve an additional investment in infrastructure and construction of another $30 million,&quot; said the company in a statement.</p>
<p>The first cinemas will be opened this year, with the rest completed in 1998.</p>
<p>(( Rodrigo Martinez, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
